OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FA coroner has called upon the North
OL,7,FWest Ambulance Service (NWAS) to take
OL,8,Faction after they 'declined to attend'
OL,9,Fa welfare call to an elderly resident
OL,10,Fwho was later found dead.
OL,12,FThe ambulance service has defended the
OL,13,Fdecision as appropriate, saying that
OL,14,Fthe woman's location could not be
OL,15,Fdetermined, nor whether that there was
OL,16,Fa confirmed medical need.
OL,18,F72-year-old Lesley Higginson was found
OL,19,Fdead at her home in Appleton near
OL,20,FWarrington on 18 January, according to
OL,21,Fa prevention of future deaths report.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
