OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FIn the report, senior coroner for
OL,7,FCheshire Jacqueline Devonish detailed
OL,8,Fhow Ms Higginson was a 'medically
OL,9,Fvulnerable adult' who was under a
OL,10,Fprogramme of 'remote welfare checks'.
OL,11,FShe wished to remain in her own home
OL,12,Fand did not wish to be attended by
OL,13,Fcarers, instead receiving a package of
OL,14,Fcare which included medication
OL,15,Fmanagement through the Medication
OL,16,FSupport Company, and the 'Okay Each
OL,17,FDay' service.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FCarried out by company Alertacall,
OL,7,Fthis was used to establish remote and
OL,8,Fdaily contact with Ms Higginson
OL,9,Fthrough a call button service - but
OL,10,FAlertacall had been 'unable' to speak
OL,11,Fto her on the weekend she died.
OL,13,FA new medication safe and computer
OL,14,Fscreen had also been installed on 13
OL,15,FJanuary. She had not answered the
OL,16,Fcalls on 16 January, resulting in a
OL,17,Fmedication support worker visiting her
OL,18,Fhome when she was present.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FThe next day the medication team were
OL,7,Fnot able to get in touch with her,
OL,8,Fwhich triggered a escalation visit
OL,9,Fafter 24 hours of no contact as per
OL,10,Fpolicy, with a neighbour asked to
OL,11,Fcheck on her, but no contact could be
OL,12,Festablished.
OL,14,F"The police declined attendance for a
OL,15,Fwelfare call," the report said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,F"The ambulance service accepted the
OL,7,Fwelfare call initially but later
OL,8,Fcalled back rejecting the request to
OL,9,Fattend, stating it was not their
OL,10,Fpolicy to accept welfare checks if
OL,11,Fthere is no confirmation someone is in
OL,12,Fthe property."
OL,14,FThe same neighbour who conducted the
OL,15,Fwelfare check 'reported having seen Ms
OL,16,FHigginson out that day', after which
OL,17,Fthe escalation was closed.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FOn 18 January there was once again no
OL,7,Fanswer from Ms Higginson and the
OL,8,Femergency services were called again,
OL,9,Fafter a neighbour reported seeing a
OL,10,F'foot on the floor' through the window.
OL,12,F"The ambulance service arrived at
OL,13,F12:34, and entry was forced by the
OL,14,FCheshire Fire and Rescue Service,
OL,15,Ffinding Mrs Higginson deceased on her
OL,16,Fbed, and confirmed her death at
OL,17,F13:03," the report stated.
OL,19,FMs Devonish said that there was a
OL,20,F'risk that future deaths could occur'.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,F"It is important to know whether there
OL,7,Fis an established policy for declining
OL,8,Fwelfare calls," she wrote.
OL,10,F"The Right Care, Right Person, policy
OL,11,Fstates that the police in Cheshire
OL,12,Fwill not respond to welfare check
OL,13,Fcalls when healthcare are best placed
OL,14,Fto support those who may be in crisis.
OL,16,F"It is unclear whether a request for a
OL,17,Fwelfare check is to be deemed to be
OL,18,Fhealthcare related and whether the
OL,19,Fambulance service properly rejected
OL,20,Fthe request."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FBut in their response, the chief
OL,7,Fexecutive of NWAS defended the
OL,8,Fservice's actions, saying that their
OL,9,Fresponse had been correct according to
OL,10,Fguidelines.
OL,12,F"When the emergency call was made on
OL,13,F17 January, the caller was advised
OL,14,Fthat there was 'a 1 hour 20 minute to
OL,15,F1 hour 50 minute response time," their
OL,16,Fresponse read.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FA paramedic called back at 3:30pm and
OL,7,Fadvised that 'due to the location of
OL,8,FMs Higginson being unknown and a
OL,9,Fmedical need for an ambulance also
OL,10,Fbeing unknown, an ambulance would not
OL,11,Fbe deployed'.
OL,13,F"Guidelines provide that the patient's
OL,14,Flocation needs to be known and there
OL,15,Fneeds to be a confirmed medical need,"
OL,16,Fthe response said.
OL,18,F"NWAS need a verified location and
OL,19,Fassurance that a patient is indeed
OL,20,Fpresent at the specified location.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,F"NWAS does not have the legal powers,
OL,7,Fnor the equipment, to force entry to
OL,8,Fproperties. Our primary function is to
OL,9,Fprioritise and respond to the medical
OL,10,Fneeds of our patients.
OL,12,F"It cannot be assumed that an
OL,13,Findividual being uncontactable, means
OL,14,Fthat they require medical assistance.
OL,15,FNor do NWAS have the capacity to
OL,16,Fconduct thorough enquiries to
OL,17,Fdetermine whether an individual is
OL,18,Fexperiencing physical or mental health
OL,19,Fconcerns."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786886308
OL,3,CWoman found dead hours after ambulance
OL,4,Cservice declined welfare call
OL,6,FThe response continued that the
OL,7,Fservice's lead for mental health and
OL,8,Fsuicide prevention had listened to the
OL,9,F999 calls and confirmed that the call
OL,10,F'was handled appropriately and in line
OL,11,Fwith the Concern for Welfare policy'.
OL,13,F"It could not be determined that Ms
OL,14,FHigginson was at the specified
OL,15,Flocation or that she had a confirmed
OL,16,Fhealth complaint," it concluded.
OL,18,F"It was therefore correct that NWAS
OL,19,Fdid not deploy an ambulance to Ms
OL,20,FHigginson based on the information
OL,21,Fprovided at the time of the call."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
